mor as a 2025 Just for Laughs New Face\; on Kill Tony\, The Tonight Show w/
 
 Jimmy Fallon\, Don't Tell and Funny AF w/ Kevin Hart. Door Time: 9:30pm. S
 
how Time: 10:00pm. Join us in our lobby bar before the show! 21 & over w/ v
 
alid\, government-issued photo ID. General Admission standing & seating. *S
 
eating is 1st come 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive early for best selec
 
tion. **If you have an accessibility request\, please email thebellhouse@li
 
venation.com prior. ***No outside food/drink. $.25 per each ticket sold for
 
 a majority of events at The Bell House benefits Comedy Gives Back\, a safe
 
ty net for the comedy community. IG: @comedygivesback. Tickets & info: http
 
