DESCRIPTION:As Part of The New York Comedy Festival. Jay Jurden is the star
 
 of the new Hulu comedy special Yes Ma'am\, a breakout hour that solidifies
 
 him as 1 of the sharpest & most original comedic voices working today. Bas
 
ed in New York & originally from Mississippi\, Jay has become a national st
 
andout thanks to his precise writing\, magnetic presence & a point of view 
 
that is both deeply personal & universally funny. The special is now availa
 
ble on all streaming platforms. Door Time: 3pm (front bar opens: 2pm). Show
 
 Time: 4pm. 21 & over w/ valid\, government-issued photo ID. General Admiss
 
ion standing & seating. *Seating 1st come 1st served & not guaranteed. Arri
 
ve early for best selection. **If you have an accessibility request\, pleas
 
e email thebellhouse@livenation.com prior. No outside food\, drink. $.25 pe
 
r each ticket sold for a majority of events at The Bell House benefits Come
 
dy Gives Back\, a safety net for the comedy community. IG: @comedygivesback
 
. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/jay-jurden-brooklyn-new-york
 
-11-07-2026/event/30006511E19D98F2
