SUMMARY:Ehud Asherie Trio
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Pianist and composer Ehud Asherie\, an artist inspired by diver
 
se eras and mingling traditions\, has cultivated a unique sound both on the
 
 bandstand and in the studio. With a deep commitment to spontaneity\, Asher
 
ie captivates listeners as he and his quartet navigate syncopated phrases a
 
nd evolving harmonic landscapes. Lauded as \, "rdquo" -> a master of swing 
 
and stride" by The New Yorker\, Asherie will present a mix of original work
 
s and beloved compositions\, joined by frequent collaborators and New York 
 
jazz legends\, John Webber on Bass and Kenny Washington on Drums. This perf
 
ormance promises to be a journey through the vibrant tapestry of jazz\, gui
 
ded by Asherie's distinct musical voice. Ehud Asherie\, Yasushi Nakamura\, 
 
and Kush Abadey Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/ehud-asheri
 
